        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-87005, Modern Tribeca Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Tribeca Appliance Pull is one of our most stunning collection. There is something so riveting about the faceted design that is all at once vintage and modern feeling--the perfect transitional Refrigerator Handle. The Tribeca Appliance Pull is available in all the most popular finish colors. It comes packaged with the installation hardware needed to install it on your kitchen appliance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/tribeca-cabinet-pull-emtek-86428\"><b>Emtek Tribeca Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Tribeca Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87005-specifications.pdf?v=1704262416\"><b>Emtek Tribeca Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-87005:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-87006:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
